  "identifier": "hapi-fhir",
  "name": "HAPI FHIR",
  "alternateName": [
    "HAPI FHIR JPA Server",
    "HAPI FHIR Client"
  ],
  "description": "The most widely used open-source Java implementation of the HL7 FHIR standard. Provides both a client library and a full JPA server with database persistence, supporting FHIR DSTU2, DSTU3, R4, R4B, and R5. Includes REST API, validation, search parameters, batch processing, and Spring Boot integration. The de facto reference implementation for FHIR servers in open-source healthcare infrastructure — used by academic medical centres, national health systems, and open health platforms worldwide. Apache-2.0, 2.3k stars, 1.5k forks, v8.0.0 (May 2026). Commercial support available through Smile CDR (the primary maintainer).",
  "url": "https://hapifhir.io/",
