  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source FHIR server implementation — if you need a FHIR server, HAPI FHIR is the default starting point. Apache-2.0, supports all FHIR versions from DSTU2 through R5, JPA persistence, full REST API, and Spring Boot integration. 2.3k stars, 1.5k forks, v8.0.0 released May 2026 — actively maintained by Smile CDR with broad community contribution. Used by national health systems, academic medical centres, and open platforms worldwide. Adopt as the standard FHIR server for any team building FHIR-native infrastructure in Java.",
